  m_text: "<size=20>-Each Free Games can only be triggered through winning a relevant
    Musketeer Stop.\n\n-All Wilds during Free Games appear with a multiplier.\n     -Aramis
    Free Games \u2013 Wilds appear with Multiplier <style=coinColor><b>X2</b></style>\n
    \    -Parthos Free Games \u2013 Wilds appear with Multiplier <style=coinColor><b>X3</b></style>\n
    \    -Athos Free Games \u2013 Wilds appear with Multiplier <style=coinColor><b>X4</b></style>\n\n-The
    number of spins for each Free Games depends on the number \n  of complete missions
    of the same type."
